            <ArticleTitle>The use of phenothiazines and tricyclic antidepressants in the treatment of intractable pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>246-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The use of trifluoperazine and amitriptyline in the treatment of pain is described. Of 12 patients who were suffering chronic pain from various causes, 8 obtained a major degree of relief from the use of this combination of drugs.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
